Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:51:05 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 176/177] Meridian: background tasks in Mission Control; Always
 allow for the agent

A session whose turn is over but that still runs a command in the background
shows as at work. The browser agent's question offers Always allow (full
access from then on).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
